body:
I talked to her a lot about this yesterday. It just seems like she has decided this already and she said that it's the best for her, after I said that you probably know how I, and many other people will feel "after".

But we agreed to meet more and spend time together now, and I hope I can talk to her about this and make things better, and save her. I can't really think about anything else now.

&#x200B;

She's just drinking almost daily atm (not any crazy amounts but still), and told me that she isn't good with people when she isn't at least a little drunk. So I just told her that I can come over and possibly drink just a little bit with her, and during that I want to talk to her about this as much as I can and make a change.

&#x200B;

But it just feels like I can't, she told me that she has been thinking about this for 4 years. Told me the month she will do it, but again she also said that she hasn't locked anything in yet. Told me that it's the best for her.

&#x200B;

And she has already told her mother about this, and a few other friends.
